=== UHS H2-brine-calcite kinetic network with honest bands ===
    after Ghaedi, Gholami, Bellas & Stamatakis, GHG: Sci. Technol.
    15(6):757-768 (2025), DOI 10.1002/ghg.2368 — CLOSED ACCESS;
    skeleton = abstract oracles + public PHREEQC-database anchors;
    AWAITING-AUTHOR-DATA slots labeled in the file header.

  Network (6 species, 5 reactions, C1-C6 labels):
    R0  H2 + CO2 -> CH4            pseudo-sink, k_m ILLUSTRATIVE (S2)
    R1  Calcite -> Ca+2 + HCO3-    PWP acid channel, aH folded (C1)
    R2  Calcite + CO2 -> Ca+2 + 2HCO3-  PWP CO2 channel (P1)
    R3  Calcite -> Ca+2 + HCO3-    PWP water channel (P1)
    R4  Ca+2 + HCO3- -> Calcite    closure k_b = k3/K4 (C5)

  Brine (C2): pH2 = 15 atm Henry charge, salting 0.85 in [0.70,1.00];
  Ca = 1e-3, HCO3 = 5e-4, CO2 = 0.05, Calcite = 1.0 mol/L; 30 yr,
  RK4 dt = 0.05 yr x 600 (dt-converged to 1e-12, C4). Engine
  findings E1-E5 and monotonicity labels M1-M2: file header.

